# Conformance probe pack for the transform `iso8601_short` (spec 0.18) on
# the `json` wire. Public. No kinds. One key, time_ms, at two members: `ms`
# as the integer, so an instant is given exactly, and `t` through
# `iso8601_short`. Decode takes the earliest line whose member is present
# (Version 0.6, One key at several locators); encode writes both.
format  conformance-cond-time
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire    json
field   time_ms  ms  int
field   time_ms  t   iso8601_short
